message: "If you use this code, please cite the original studies and this repository."
title: "Tumour-infiltrating immune cell scRNA-seq reanalyses"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Corvino
    given-names: Dillon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0683-1369"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Eomesodermin/tumour-immune-scrnaseq-reanalyses"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23975525
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-04"
abstract: "Reanalyses of seven public tumour immune-cell atlases and cohorts (a pan-cancer NK atlas, a harmonised pan-cancer TIL collection, a pan-cancer immune atlas, two glioblastoma datasets, head and neck cancer and melanoma), used to ask where NK/T-cell genes and signatures of interest (NKG7, TLR2, CD160, CD226/DNAM-1, DGAT, CXCL12) are expressed in tumours."
